{"unit_id":"tag:08VU:proof","translation":"蕴含 (1) <MATH_0001> (2) 由《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001> 推出。对于逆向，假设 <MATH_0002> 有限表示（finite presentation）。我们可以且确实假设 <MATH_0003>。由引理 <REF_0002>，有短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0004>。设 <MATH_0005> 是 <MATH_0006> 的对象（object），使 <MATH_0007> 有表示（presentation）\n<MATH_0008>。将 <MATH_0009> 替换为某个覆盖（covering）的成员后，可假设映射（map）<MATH_0010> 提升为映射（map）<MATH_0011>。诱导映射（induced map）<MATH_0012> 为满射（surjective），这是由 <MATH_0013> 的右正合性（right exactness）得到的。因此，将 <MATH_0014> 替换为某个覆盖（covering）的成员后，可找到提升（lift）<MATH_0015>，它提升给定映射（map）<MATH_0016>，使\n<MATH_0017>\n成为复形（complex）。再次使用 <MATH_0018> 的右正合性（right exactness），可知此复形（complex）正合（exact）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"presentation","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"right exactness","target_term":"右正合性"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"right exactness","target_term":"右正合性"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示","context":"模的性质。"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"加厚给出的序列。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"景的对象。"},{"source_term":"presentation","target_term":"表示","context":"局部有限表示。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"