{"unit_id":"tag:08MS:proof","translation":"由引理 <REF_0001> 的证明清楚可知，<MATH_0001> 经由映射（map）\n<MATH_0002>\n得到的边界（boundary）为零，是存在提升（lift）的充要条件。由于\n<MATH_0003>，\n可得结论；此等式来自 <MATH_0004> 与 <MATH_0005> 在导出范畴（derived category）上的伴随性（adjointness）（《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"boundary","target_term":"边界"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"Hom 到 Ext 的边界映射。"},{"source_term":"boundary","target_term":"边界","context":"原映射的 Ext 类。"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升","context":"所求线性提升。"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"函子的伴随。"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性","context":"Ri_* 与 Li^*。"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":[]}
